        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-degree-p13-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "到处 + predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "到处 describes a situation throughout relevant places. Its scope is spatial, not every person or every time.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这里到处都是人。",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ dàochù dōu shì rén 。",
                "meaning": "There are people everywhere here.",
                "audio": "3a7a38a737d0dbc7853f6f65daaed70d2c03c860e27f87d32612d48ab5838aab"
              },
              {
                "text": "他到处找书。",
                "pinyin": "tā dàochù zhǎo shū 。",
                "meaning": "He looks everywhere for the book.",
                "audio": "d360189e71009d6f7b49905d47a6ef6baf4038b56c881a40a005a0ea74c240ee"
              }
            ]
          },
